      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per hour\n\nTrigger Olansa successfully uses Stealth to Hide and become hidden from all of her current foes, or she uses Stealth to Sneak and become undetected to all her current foes\n\n---\n\nEffect Olansa becomes Invisible for 1 minute, even if she uses a hostile action. Not even Revealing Light, See the Unseen, or similar effects can reveal her, though creatures can still use the Seek action to locate her.",
